[{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-041","subject":"臨床医学大要","topic":"間質性肺疾患の所見","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"間質性肺疾患でみられやすい呼吸機能所見はどれか。","choices":["拘束性換気障害と肺拡散能低下","閉塞性換気障害だけが必発する","残気量だけが必ず著増する","呼吸機能は常に正常である","肺拡散能が必ず上昇する"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"ILD＝拘束性＋DLCO低下が典型。運動時低酸素にも注意。","explanation":"間質性肺疾患では肺のコンプライアンス低下により肺活量が減少し、肺胞毛細血管膜の障害からDLCOが低下しやすい。","sourceTitle":"ATS Interstitial Lung Disease resources","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK541084/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"41","rightsBasis":"疾患の一般的生理を独自作問。画像・表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-042","subject":"理学療法","topic":"ICU-AWとMRC sum score","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"MRC sum scoreがICU-acquired weaknessの評価で主に用いられる目的はどれか。","choices":["複数筋群の随意筋力をまとめて評価する","意識レベルだけを評価する","肺拡散能だけを評価する","骨密度だけを評価する","認知症だけを評価する"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"MRC sum score＝複数の代表筋群の随意筋力を合計して全身筋力低下を捉える。","explanation":"ICU-AWの臨床評価では、覚醒し指示理解が可能な患者で複数筋群の随意筋力をMRC法で評価し、その総合値を利用する。本教材では採点表やカットオフの丸暗記を目的にしない。","sourceTitle":"ICU-acquired weakness review","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7224132/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"42","rightsBasis":"尺度の目的だけを独自作問。評価票・採点表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-043","subject":"リハビリテーション医学","topic":"介護予防の低栄養判定BMI","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"BMIの計算式として正しいのはどれか。","choices":["体重kg÷身長mの2乗","身長m÷体重kgの2乗","体重kg×身長m","体重kg÷年齢","身長cm÷体重kg"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"BMI＝体重kg÷身長m²。高齢者の栄養評価はBMIだけでなく体重変化・摂取量・疾患も合わせる。","explanation":"BMIは体重kgを身長mの2乗で除して求める。高齢者の低栄養評価では単一のBMI値だけで確定せず、体重減少、食事摂取、筋量、疾患などを合わせて評価する。","sourceTitle":"WHO BMI / nutrition assessment principles","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.who.int/data/gho/data/themes/topics/topic-details/GHO/body-mass-index"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"43","rightsBasis":"BMIの算式を独自作問。制度上の可変カットオフを固定しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-044","subject":"リハビリテーション医学","topic":"介護保険の住宅改修","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"介護保険の住宅改修で対象となり得る代表的な工事はどれか。","choices":["手すりの取付け","趣味目的の大型テレビ設置","庭の全面造園","家全体の建て替え","自家用車の購入"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"住宅改修＝手すり、段差解消、滑りにくい床、扉・便器変更などが代表。事前確認が必要。","explanation":"介護保険の住宅改修には手すりの取付けなど、在宅生活の安全と自立を支える一定の工事が対象となる。実際の給付では事前申請や自治体確認が必要である。","sourceTitle":"厚生労働省 介護保険における住宅改修","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.mhlw.go.jp/stf/seisakunitsuite/bunya/0000212398.html"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"44","rightsBasis":"現行制度の代表対象を独自作問。金額等の可変情報を固定しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-045","subject":"リハビリテーション医学","topic":"特別支援学校の教育環境","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"障害のある児童生徒の教育環境を整える考え方として適切なのはどれか。","choices":["個々の教育的ニーズに応じて合理的配慮や支援環境を検討する","障害名だけで全員同じ環境にする","移動やコミュニケーションの障壁を評価しない","本人・保護者の意向を一切聞かない","医療的ケアが必要なら教育機会を認めない"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"特別支援教育＝個々のニーズに応じて学習・移動・コミュニケーション環境を調整。","explanation":"特別支援教育では障害の状態、学習上・生活上の困難、本人・保護者の意向などを踏まえ、必要な合理的配慮や支援を個別に検討する。","sourceTitle":"文部科学省 特別支援教育","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.mext.go.jp/a_menu/shotou/tokubetu/main.htm"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"45","rightsBasis":"教育支援の高位原則を独自作問。教材・様式は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-046","subject":"理学療法","topic":"NICU低緊張児の理学療法","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"NICUで低緊張を示す乳児への理学療法で最も重要な考え方はどれか。","choices":["呼吸・循環の安定性と発達段階を確認し、過剰刺激を避けて姿勢や運動経験を支援する","覚醒状態に関係なく強い刺激を続ける","呼吸状態を確認しない","疼痛反応を無視する","全乳児に同じ姿勢だけを強制する"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"NICU介入＝まず生理的安定。発達支持・ポジショニング・家族支援を個別化。","explanation":"NICUでは呼吸・循環・覚醒状態が未熟または不安定なため、生理的安定を優先し、発達に合わせたポジショニングや運動経験を過剰刺激にならない範囲で支援する。","sourceTitle":"Developmental care in NICU review","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5516945/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"46","rightsBasis":"乳児写真を使わず安全原則を独自作問。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-047","subject":"リハビリテーション医学","topic":"予防接種法の定期接種","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"予防接種法に基づく定期接種の目的として適切なのはどれか。","choices":["対象疾病の発生やまん延を予防し、公衆衛生の向上を図る","すべての感染症を治療する","骨折を予防する","関節可動域を改善する","筋力を測定する"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"定期接種＝法律に基づく予防接種。対象疾病・年齢・制度は更新されるため現行情報を確認。","explanation":"定期予防接種は予防接種法に基づき、感染症の発生・まん延予防と国民の健康保持に資する公衆衛生施策である。対象ワクチンの詳細は制度改定があるため固定暗記にしない。","sourceTitle":"厚生労働省 予防接種情報","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.mhlw.go.jp/stf/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/kenkou/kekkaku-kansenshou/yobou-sesshu/index.html"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"47","rightsBasis":"制度の目的のみを独自作問。可変の接種スケジュールを固定しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-048","subject":"理学療法","topic":"歩行練習中の転倒時対応","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"歩行練習中に患者がバランスを崩したときの対応として適切なのはどれか。","choices":["無理に引き上げず、頭部を守りながら可能な範囲で安全に床へ誘導し、その後に受傷評価を行う","腕だけを強く引っ張る","転倒後の痛みや意識を確認しない","すぐに歩行を再開する","転倒記録を残さない"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"転倒時＝無理に支え切らない。頭部保護→安全に下降→意識・疼痛・外傷評価→報告。","explanation":"患者の体重を無理に引き上げると双方が受傷し得る。可能なら身体を近づけ、頭部を保護しながら制御して床へ誘導し、転倒後は意識・疼痛・外傷を評価して施設手順に従う。","sourceTitle":"Patient fall safety principles","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ahrq.gov/patient-safety/settings/hospital/fall-prevention/toolkit/index.html"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"48","rightsBasis":"転倒時の安全原則を独自作問。既存動画・画像は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-049","subject":"臨床医学大要","topic":"骨折の名称と部位","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"Colles骨折が生じる部位はどれか。","choices":["橈骨遠位端","上腕骨近位端","大腿骨頸部","脛骨近位端","鎖骨中央部"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"Colles＝橈骨遠位端骨折で遠位骨片が背側転位する典型型。","explanation":"Colles骨折は伸展位手関節での転倒などで生じる橈骨遠位端骨折の代表的パターンで、遠位骨片の背側転位を伴う。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Colles Fracture","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK553071/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"49","rightsBasis":"骨折名称と解剖部位を独自作問。X線画像は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-050","subject":"理学療法","topic":"ADL評価尺度","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"Barthel Indexの主な用途はどれか。","choices":["基本的ADLの自立度・介助量を評価する","骨密度を測定する","認知症だけを診断する","肺活量を測る","末梢神経伝導速度を測る"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"Barthel Index＝基本ADLの自立度・介助量評価。","explanation":"Barthel Indexは食事、移動、排泄など基本的ADLの自立度を評価する尺度である。本教材では項目文や配点表を転載しない。","sourceTitle":"Barthel Index overview","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/14258950/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"50","rightsBasis":"尺度の目的のみ独自作問。項目・配点表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-051","subject":"解剖学","topic":"関節の形態分類","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"球関節に分類されるのはどれか。","choices":["股関節","肘関節","近位橈尺関節","指節間関節","距腿関節"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"球関節＝肩・股。蝶番＝肘・指節間など。車軸＝橈尺など。","explanation":"股関節は大腿骨頭が寛骨臼にはまり、多軸性の運動が可能な球関節である。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Joint Classification","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK546683/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"51","rightsBasis":"関節形態の基礎事実を独自作問。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-052","subject":"解剖学","topic":"Jacoby線と腰椎レベル","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"Jacoby線（両側腸骨稜最高点を結ぶ線）が臨床で用いられる目的はどれか。","choices":["下位腰椎の椎体・椎間レベルを推定する体表指標","肩関節可動域を測る","足関節角度を測る","視力を測る","肺活量を測る"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"Jacoby線＝両腸骨稜最高点を結ぶ体表ランドマーク。概ねL4付近だが個人差あり。","explanation":"Jacoby線は腰椎穿刺や体表解剖で下位腰椎レベルを推定するランドマークとして用いられるが、実際の椎体レベルには個人差がある。","sourceTitle":"Lumbar surface landmark studies","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4488182/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"52","rightsBasis":"体表解剖の目的を独自作問。固定レベルを絶対視しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-053","subject":"解剖学","topic":"滑車神経と上斜筋","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"滑車神経が支配する外眼筋はどれか。","choices":["上斜筋","外側直筋","下斜筋","内側直筋","上直筋"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"SO4 LR6 AO3＝上斜筋IV、外側直筋VI、その他III。","explanation":"滑車神経（第IV脳神経）は上斜筋を運動支配する。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Trochlear Nerve Anatomy","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08b_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK537244/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"53","rightsBasis":"脳神経解剖を独自作問。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-PM-054","subject":"解剖学","topic":"温痛覚の伝導路","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"体幹・四肢の温痛覚を主に上行させる伝導路はどれか。","choices":["脊髄視床路","後索だけ","皮質脊髄路","視索","錐体路だけ"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":